  "details": "I and I'm sure many other people use VRCFaceTracking to power their face tracking. \n\nWhen using Selfie Expression, these two systems combine and end up morphing the face tracking in undesirable ways. \n\nFor example, with my Lasyusha edit, when smiling, there ends up being a gap between my teeth when both are enabled. \n\nLeft is with selfie expression enabled, right is disabled. \n\nIt would still be nice to use Selfie Expression to move your upper body + arms + hands, but without the added face tracking it provides. \n\nA toggle to turn off the face tracking that comes with Selfie Expression would solve this issue. \n\nPlease, and thank you. 🙏",
